For one photon, $\begin{aligned}
|\vec p_\gamma|
&=\frac{E_\gamma}{c}
=\frac{hf}{c}.\end{aligned}$ For light, $\lambda f=c,
\qquad
\frac{f}{c}=\frac{1}{\lambda},$ and therefore $|\vec p_\gamma|=\frac{hf}{c}=\frac{h}{\lambda}.$

